Test-only changes to modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps examples/basic-host (ext-apps 2.0.3).
Apply from the basic-host directory:  patch -p1 < <this file>

- STRICT_SPEC_CSP=1 serves the sandbox with the spec's reference CSP (no blob:, no 'unsafe-eval',
  no worker-src) instead of basic-host's permissive one, so the main-thread worker fallback is
  exercised.
- Advertises the `message` host capability (basic-host handles ui/message but does not declare
  it, so the view hides its "Tell me more" button there).
- Logs app log messages as JSON, so the view's diagnostics are readable in the host console.

